/build/*
!/build/container/
!/build/container/**
/dist/
/target/
/book/book/

# Key material must never reach a commit, whatever path it is dropped at: the
# development signing keys under build/dev-keys, and any TLS-inspection CA or
# private key an operator points the build at. These are catch-all patterns
# rather than specific paths precisely because the paths are configurable.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.gpg
*-ca.crt
